nexo-client (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Java is installed automatically when the machine has none new enough,
    and an instance can be pointed at a specific runtime.
  * Windows: the account store no longer starts PowerShell on every read,
    which was causing console windows and stutter.

 -- Lokifisch <lokifisch@lokifisch.dev>  Fri, 14 Aug 2026 14:30:00 +0200

